OL,3,GNEWSANine arrested in teen murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of nine people have now been
OL,7,Farrested as police continue
OL,8,Finvestigating the death of a teenager
OL,9,Fin Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to a property on
OL,12,FBrookhouse Road in Meir at about 23:45
OL,13,FBST on 9 October, where 19-year-old
OL,14,FBradley Whieldon was pronounced dead at
OL,15,Fthe scene.
OL,17,FAnother man, also aged 19, suffered
OL,18,Fserious injuries and remained in
OL,19,Fhospital in a stable condition, police
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
