OL,3,GNEWSANine arrested in teen murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy from Hanley has
OL,7,Falready been charged with murder and
OL,8,Fattempted murder. He was remanded into
OL,9,Fyouth detention and is due to appear at
OL,10,FStafford Crown Court on 23 November.
